<mjml lang="en-AU">
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Re: Change of install day</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>You can change your install day on your job page, and your installer is told straight away.</mj-preview>
    <mj-include path="./partials/head.mjml" />
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body>
    <mj-wrapper css-class="card">
      <mj-include path="./partials/header.mjml" />

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text mj-class="hi">Hi Helen,</mj-text>
          <mj-text mj-class="h1" css-class="email-heading" padding="4px 12px 10px">No problem</mj-text>
          <mj-text>You can change your install day on your job page. Your installer will be told straight away.</mj-text>
          <mj-button href="https://estimate.homeinsulationvictoria.com.au/my-job/TEST?screen=book">Change my install day</mj-button>
          <mj-text mj-class="small" padding="0 12px 14px">Or open this link: <a href="https://estimate.homeinsulationvictoria.com.au/my-job/TEST?screen=book" style="color:#3C51C4;font-weight:700;word-break:break-all;">https://estimate.homeinsulationvictoria.com.au/my-job/TEST?screen=book</a></mj-text>
          <mj-text>If you'd rather cancel, you can do that on the same page. Or reply to this email and we'll sort it out with you.</mj-text>
          <mj-text padding="0 12px 0">— Home Insulation Victoria</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-include path="./partials/footer-trade.mjml" />
    </mj-wrapper>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
